  epo:specifiesProcurementCriterion <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/42297ee4-5627-4db3-aa30-71fe3b322807-02/AwardCriterion$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_AwardingTerms1_AwardingCriterion1_SubordinateAwardingCriterion1>,
